OL,3,GNEWSADemonstrations held a year after
OL,4,Afirst protests at asylum seekers hotel
OL,5,
OL,6,FDemonstrations have been held in
OL,7,FFalkirk almost a year after groups
OL,8,Fclashed outside a former hotel which
OL,9,Fwas housing asylum seekers.
OL,11,FAnti-immigration group Voices for
OL,12,FFalkirk gathered outside the Cladhan
OL,13,FHotel ` the scene of several clashes
OL,14,Flast summer - on Saturday as part of an
OL,15,Fevent under the banner "The Right
OL,16,FUnites".
OL,18,FMeanwhile, pro-immigration
OL,19,Fdemonstrators Falkirk For All and Stand
OL,20,FUp To Racism took part in a unity march
OL,21,Fthrough the town.
OL,23,APub: 15-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
